  "notes": [
    "The tile is the one of resource.tile.rect.",
    "rect-tile-ov sets object variable 695 to the negative tile index. rect-tile-vf calls vs.SetVectorFill with the tile name. The live run records which rectangle draws the tile. Keep that one and drop the other in revision 2.",
